摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness(dsh) for VS Code","id":"gh:1333400012","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"deepseek-harness-dsh-for-vscode","slug":"Xizhi1024/deepseek-harness-dsh-for-vscode","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","sidebar","vscode","vscode-extension"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness(dsh) for VS Code"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness(dsh) for VS Code"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**A Cursor-like AI coding experience inside VS Code — powered by your own DeepSeek Harness (DSH) age"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ursor-like AI coding experience inside VS Code — powered by your own DeepSeek Harness (DSH) agent.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Embeds the full DSH web UI in the VS Code auxiliary sidebar: every window automatically starts and o"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"wns a local `dsh web` service (cwd = current workspace), so your modules, skills, MCP servers, crede"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ntials and sessions all just work. On top of that it adds the IDE integration layer:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Chat in the sidebar**: `Ctrl+Alt+B` opens it; copy/paste/context menu, file jumps and theme foll"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"owing are all native\n- **Context attachment**: right-click a file / selection / folder / Problems to"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" append a compact link to the DSH draft — source text is never pasted, nothing is ever auto-sent\n- *"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"*DSH Changes review**: workspace edits pushed by DSH land in a dedicated tree with diff / accept / u"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ndo; every write needs explicit approval (on by default)\n- **@dsh chat participant**: type `@dsh` in"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" the native VS Code chat to talk to your local DSH session with streaming replies — zero Copilot quo"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ta (on by default)\n- **Advanced, opt-in**: Ctrl+K / Ctrl+I inline edit, model routing into the VS Co"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"de LM picker, MCP consumption, terminal / UI bridges, FIM tab completion — every capability behind a"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"n explicit consent switch"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ⚠️ Compatibility"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Item | Requirement |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| VS Code | ≥ 1.106, desktop only; remote / virtual / untrusted workspaces not supported |\n| DSH CLI"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" | `npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh`, ≥ 0.1.0-rc.7 recommended (older runtimes auto-retry degraded, some f"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"eatures limited) |\n| Node.js | auto-detected; set `dsh.local.nodePath` for non-standard locations |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 📦 Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Marketplace (recommended)**: search **DeepSeek Harness** (publisher Xizhi1024) in the Extensions"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" view, or `code --install-extension Xizhi1024.dsh-vs-sidebar`\n- **VSIX**: download from Releases → `"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"Extensions: Install from VSIX...`"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 🚀 Usage"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Press `Ctrl+Alt+B` — the extension starts (or reuses) the local `dsh web` and loads the UI\n2. Sel"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ect code → right-click **Add to DSH Thread**; the draft receives a compact `file:line` link, press E"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"nter to send\n3. Type `@dsh` + your question in the VS Code chat — replies stream from your local DSH"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" session\n4. Let DSH propose an edit through the bridge: it lands in the **DSH Changes** view for dif"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"f / accept / undo — nothing is written without approval"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Common commands (palette, `DSH:` prefix): New / Switch Session · Open Session History · Restart / St"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"op Server · Open in Browser · New DSH Instance (Ctrl+Alt+N) · Diagnose · Restart Cleanly · Set DSH F"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" Open in Browser · New DSH Instance (Ctrl+Alt+N) · Diagnose · Restart Cleanly · Set DSH FIM API Key."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Key | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `dsh.port` | 3080 | Port for the DSH web server |\n| `dsh.autoStart` | true | Start the service whe"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"n VS Code opens |\n| `dsh.home.mode` | shared | shared = official ~/.dsh; isolated = extension-privat"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"e home |\n| `dsh.profile` | web | DSH profile directory name |\n| `dsh.executablePath` | (empty) | Exp"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"licit DSH executable / package dir / shim; takes precedence over discovery |\n| `dsh.closePolicy` | o"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"nVscodeExit | When to stop the owned server |\n| `dsh.features.changes-review` | true | DSH changes r"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"eview (approval-gated writes) |\n| `dsh.changes.observe-tools` | true | Attribute tool-made edits in "},{"id":"p17s7","text":"the changes tree (tool group) |\n| `dsh.features.chat-participant` | true | @dsh chat participant |\n|"},{"id":"p17s8","text":" `dsh.features.ctrl-k` / `ctrl-i` | false | Inline edit commands (Ctrl+K / Ctrl+I) |\n| `dsh.features"},{"id":"p17s9","text":".lm-route` | false | Expose DSH models in the VS Code LM picker |\n| `dsh.features.mcp-consume` | fal"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"se | Let DSH consume VS Code-side MCP servers |\n| `dsh.features.tab-completion` | false | FIM tab co"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"mpletion — needs `dsh.fim.baseUrl` + **DSH: Set FIM API Key**, then restart the DSH server |\n| `dsh."},{"id":"p17s12","text":"fim.baseUrl` | (empty) | Upstream FIM endpoint (full URL of an OpenAI-compatible completions API) |\n"},{"id":"p17s13","text":"| `dsh.keybindings.ctrlL` | true | Ctrl+L adds the selection to the thread (never sends) |\n| `dsh.br"},{"id":"p17s14","text":"idge.terminal` / `editorRead` / `ui` | false | Terminal / editor-read / UI surface bridges (consent "},{"id":"p17s15","text":"al` / `editorRead` / `ui` | false | Terminal / editor-read / UI surface bridges (consent switches) |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Full key list in `package.json`; run **DSH: Diagnose** for a health summary."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
